{"id":"vod_sn_38825","vodId":"38825","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"爱杀宝贝","name_cn":"爱杀宝贝","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3021f3512c4561c427b8828f759934df.jpg"},"summary":"表面上看来，索尼娅（田村睦心 配音）是一个扎着双马尾的金发美少女高中生，但实际上，她有着一个秘密的身份——杀手。作为一名杀手，索尼娅有着异常敏锐的神经，任何突然靠近她的生物，都会受到她的强力攻击。少女折部安奈（赤崎千夏 配音）自称是索尼娅的朋友，但似乎没有得到索尼娅的认可。因为其大大咧咧的天然呆个性，安奈经常成为索尼娅本能攻击的受害者。　　在无意间，安奈发现，虽然索尼娅是个令人闻风丧胆的杀手，但她在昆虫和妖怪方面却有着意外小的胆量，这也成为了拉近二人关系的重要契机。同时，索尼娅的杀手同事吴织亚切（高部爱 配音），毫无存在感的不知名少女（钉宫理惠 配音）也来到了安奈的身边，杀手和少女们热闹的日常生活展开了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BQBr8nYcwu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dfZUjdxtdM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rv2gDcRPhY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5z7QvXqmb11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QJ3VkUZZGu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h6ZF9DiDne1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rJhae2cefp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XAz19pwViQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cvbX6pXQs51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1F1eZFjGBf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1sb6pR4awP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7VUz33dm9J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FFjQURyF7J1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:54.055Z"}